    "FIKA publishes a dimensioned drawing (480 x 120 x 30 mm, every edge depth and both sloper angles); positions are traced from it, expect +-2 mm.",
    "The top slopers alternate 25/35/25/35 degrees left to right, so the 25 degree pair and the 35 degree pair are not mirror images: each pair sits one slot further right on the right-hand side.",
    "The 30 mm round holes at the bottom corners and the 30 mm trough in the middle are through-holes: the trough is a jug for pull-ups, the corner holes take the hanging rope or a finger.",
    "The Vetelängd hangs from its rope or mounts on a wall; the slopers only work wall-mounted."
